---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '@/components/Section.astro';

const title = 'Neimr - Terms of Use';
const description = 'Terms of Use for Neimr - Find the Perfect Name Together';
---

<Base head={{ title, description }}>
	<Section>
		<article class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h1>Terms of Use for Neimr</h1>
			<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Last updated: November 25, 2026</p>

			<p>
				These terms apply to <strong>Neimr: Baby Name Matcher</strong> ("Neimr", "the app"), published by <strong>tskulbru</strong>. By using the app you agree to them. If you downloaded Neimr from the App Store, Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Standard EULA</a> also applies.
			</p>

			<h2>Using Neimr</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Neimr is intended for adults (18+).</li>
				<li>You can use the app as a guest or sign in with Apple or Google. You are responsible for who you share your list codes and invite links with.</li>
				<li>Don't use list names or other text you enter to harass anyone or to share unlawful content.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Neimr Premium</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Premium is an auto-renewing subscription (weekly, monthly or yearly). Prices are shown in the app before you buy.</li>
				<li>Payment is charged to your Google Play or Apple account. The subscription renews automatically at the same price unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.</li>
				<li>If a free trial is offered, you are charged when the trial ends unless you cancel before then.</li>
				<li>Cancel anytime in Google Play (Payments &amp; subscriptions) or in your Apple ID subscription settings. Refunds are handled by Google or Apple under their policies.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Content</h2>
			<p>
				Name meanings, origins and popularity are provided for inspiration and may not be complete or accurate. Always double-check a name before relying on it.
			</p>

			<h2>No warranty and limitation of liability</h2>
			<p>
				Neimr is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from your use of the app. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer protection law.
			</p>

			<h2>Changes and termination</h2>
			<p>
				We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version. You can stop using Neimr and delete your account at any time, as described in our <a href="/apps/neimr-privacy#delete-account">Privacy Policy</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:neimr@tskulbru.dev">neimr@tskulbru.dev</a>.</p>

			<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg">
				<p class="text-sm text-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					<a href="/" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">&larr; Back to tskulbru.dev</a> |
					<a href="/apps/neimr-privacy" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Privacy</a> |
					<a href="/apps/neimr-support" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Support</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</article>
	</Section>
</Base>
